      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p3-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "――梨ヶ坂市役所では、なぜか戸籍の請求が増えていた。",
          "en": "—For some reason, family register requests were up at Nashigasaka City Hall.",
          "note": "The koseki (family register) records a Japanese citizen's birth, marriage and death. City halls issue copies."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……九十分って、映画一本だよ",
          "en": "...Ninety minutes is a whole movie"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ゲームのせいかは、分かりませんけど",
          "en": "Can't say if it's the game,"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ルーツを見たいって方が、増えて",
          "en": "but more people want to see their roots"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "いまは本籍が遠くても、ここで取れますから",
          "en": "These days you can get it here even if your honseki is far away",
          "note": "Honseki (registered domicile): the address your family register is filed under. It can differ from where you live. Since 2024, copies can be issued at any city hall."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "本人が来れば、ですね",
          "en": "If you come in person, that is"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "また日本・男性!! 定年まで地下だ!!",
          "en": "Japan, male AGAIN!! Basement till retirement!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ふふ……地下って",
          "en": "Heh... basement"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-6-1",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ウケてますね",
          "en": "That's a hit"
        }
      ]
    },
