          "id": "p9-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "出生届は、お父さんかお母さんが",
          "en": "A birth notice is written by the father or mother"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "死亡届は、ご家族が書かれます",
